00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.710
Oh? My necklace...!

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:47.720
My diamond brooch, too!

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:48.880
It's the Black Knight!

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.240
We've been robbed by the Black Knight!

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:00.760
Darling! Gold coins!

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.390
And a diamond ring, as well!

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:13.050
Darling, we can get you to a doctor
and buy bread for the children now!

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.210
What a blessing...

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:16.410
It's probably a handout from the Black Knight.

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.640
I'm so grateful...

