00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:01.080
episode

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:01.080
"A Sought Encounter

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:01.080
with the Black Knight !"

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:11.690
Hmm...

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:12.750
Oh, that's right.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.180
The backdoor, backdoor...

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.330
What's the matter, Nanna?

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.550
You're being awfully careful with the locks.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.200
Well, I have to be, My Lady!

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.740
It's not safe nowadays.

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.770
You mean... the Black Knight?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.810
Yes, yes.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.210
Rumor has it that he only targets
manors owned by the nobility!

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.840
My goodness...

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:37.410
Honestly! What a rotten world it has become...

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:38.480
Where's André?

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.530
I haven't seen him around.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.490
Oh? Is he out tonight, as well?

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.390
I wonder what he's doing?

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.950
He's been going off somewhere at night, lately.

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:00.630
André!

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.130
What were you doing out this late?

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:05.600
Oh, I went out for a long ride.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.740
On a cold night like tonight?

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:10.100
It calms me down.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.690
Well, good night, Oscar.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.620
Good night.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.940
I hear he appeared at Duchess
Lamballe's ball last night.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:38.580
He was dressed all in black and wore a black mask.
They said he was incredibly agile, as well.

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.340
I won't be able to sleep soundly at this rate.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:43.550
He only targets the nobility.
Just who could he be?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.620
He's probably a commoner.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.350
Someone who is knowledgeable about
the manors of nobles and its layout.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.350
For example, he could be an
attendant or a stablehand,

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:53.310
or an underservant who works at a manor.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:54.930
I doubt it.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:57.660
They don't have the drive or the courage
to pull something like that.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.820
Oh, that's right. Oscar.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.240
I found this when I was out riding last night.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:08.410
I'm pretty sure it belongs to Madame Lamballe,
because I remember her showing it off.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.510
I see.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.200
I'll return it to her.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:24.020
What?

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.550
Make a schedule of all the
balls the nobles are hosting?

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:27.790
Yeah.

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:31.000
From now on, I'm going to
attend every ball there is.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.560
What's gotten into you all of the sudden?

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.760
I'm going to wait for the Black Knight to appear.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.850
He's most likely targeting the balls.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.310
I see.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:43.730
I'll make the schedule right away.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.710
Still, Oscar, the military police
are after the Black Knight.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:47.980
Make the schedule right away.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.580
I want to start as soon as possible.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.240
All right.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.760
The Black Knight has stopped
appearing all together,

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:14.270
as though he knows I'm after him...

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:17.610
Did you say something?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:30.710
I don't mind balls, but going night after
night is starting to wear me out.

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:34.120
According to this list, tonight's ball
is at Duke d'Enghien's manor.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:36.620
Oscar...

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:41.230
Is it really necessary to do all
this and capture him though?

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.770
It's not like he's hurting anyone,

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:48.010
and I've heard rumors he's distributing
the money and valuables to the poor.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.040
A thief is a thief.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.470
He needs to be stopped.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.070
Well, I guess that's true, too...

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.520
André!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.280
André!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.620
My Lady...

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.790
Nanna, have you seen André?

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:11.430
It's time to go the ball.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:15.210
Ah, yes... Well, he said he'd be
back in an hour or two, but...

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:16.660
What?!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:21.620
When he left, he also asked me to
tell you to wait until he returns.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.230
I see...

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.410
Very well, I'll go to the ball alone tonight.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:28.950
My Lady!

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:31.010
It's dangerous to go out alone at night!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.080
Good grief!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:35.920
Where has André gone off to,
leaving our precious Lady behind?!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.810
Idiot grandson!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.270
Oh, Madame...

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:59.080
Where did my ring go?

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:03.680
My, Madame, what happened to the brooch
you were wearing just earlier?

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:04.800
Huh? My!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:07.750
My wallet is missing!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.560
I-It's the Black Knight!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:16.960
The Black Knight has appeared!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.520
Damn you!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.630
He's trying to escape into Paris!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.040
That's...!

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.130
Palais-Royal...

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.740
Duke Orléans' residential palace!

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:37.880
<i>Duke Orléans is the King's cousin, who is seeking to be crowned the next king.</i>

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.170
<i>His residential palace, Palais-Royal...</i>

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:44.520
<i>...was rumored to be the secret
gathering place of anti-royalists.</i>

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:48.470
Still... What could the Black
Knight be doing in there?

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.660
Don't kill her. She's Regiment Commander
of the Royal Guards.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:01.240
Things will get out of hand if we kill her now.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.710
Take her alive and bring her inside!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:06.960
She's escaping!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:06.960
Don't let her get away!

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:13.710
Damn!

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:17.250
Which way?!

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.590
This way! Over here!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:19.340
All right.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.490
<i>Who are you?!</i>

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:50.750
<i>Who are you exactly?!</i>

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:53.960
<i>André?!</i>

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:54.950
<i>Is that you?!</i>

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:57.930
<i>Is that why you saved my life?!</i>

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:05.030
<i>André...!</i>

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:16.010
<i>André...!</i>

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:20.420
<i>André!</i>

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:31.820
André...

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.140
Thank goodness you woke up.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:44.040
You sure were a surprise last night.

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.940
I heard a noise, so I went to see,

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:49.110
and there you were, collapsed in
the doorway covered in blood!

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:53.780
But what surprised me more is that
you're an acquaintance of hers!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.350
Rosalie!

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:57.510
Lady Oscar...

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.960
This world can be such a small place at times.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.570
Lady Oscar!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.460
Thank goodness you woke up! Thank goodness!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:07.730
If you didn't...

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.690
I was just struck with the gun handle.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.290
That's not enough to do me in.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.500
That aside, Rosalie...
What are you doing here?

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:26.280
I had assumed you were living
at the Polignac manor.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.150
I left that house.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.980
They took me in to use me for their benefit.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:36.830
They tried to marry me off against
my will to Duke de Guiche...

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.940
...in place of my dead sister, Charlotte.

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:43.930
In the end, the only things the nobility care
about are their prestige and power.

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:46.410
It was more than I could bear,
even with my birth mother there.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.600
I hate the nobility!

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:50.410
I'm sorry...

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.770
No, it's all right...

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.980
The lady here used to be my next door
neighbor when l lived in Paris.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:01.340
She's been really good to me.

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:04.220
All right, piping hot soup, ready to be served!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.290
Yes!

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.930
Here it comes, table number 1!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.350
Thank you for waiting.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:15.330
Today's soup doesn't have anything in it really,
but it's been stewed with lots of love!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.800
Oh, but there's never anything in it!

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:19.700
Don't be so blunt now!

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:21.360
At least, there's a spoon in it!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.010
I'm sorry.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:34.420
I'm sure it's not to your taste,
but this soup is all we have right now.

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:35.750
What are you apologizing for?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.960
I haven't had such a warm and delicious
soup as this, in a very long time.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.940
I work at the market now.

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:59.110
Work starts early and is hard,
but I enjoy it every day.

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.170
Rosalie.

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:00.910
Yes?

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:05.020
Your room is still the same as you left it.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:07.030
It's been kept the same in case you returned.

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:09.820
No, Lady Oscar.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.720
I'm going to stay in Paris.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:17.120
I love this city I grew up in,
more than living in a noble's manor.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.170
Where to?

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:26.090
To Versailles.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:34.410
<i>Today's soup doesn't have anything in it really,
but it's been stewed with lots of love!</i>

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.230
<i>Oh, but there's never anything in it!</i>

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.950
The Black Knight is our ally!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:48.910
Black Knight! Give more grief to the nobles!

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:53.330
The Black Knight is our ally!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:57.730
Black Knight! Give more grief to the nobles!

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.170
Thank goodness your injury wasn't serious.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:13.600
If only you had waited a little
longer for me to return...

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:15.560
Where were you?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.730
I'm talking about when you said you'd be
back in an hour or two. Where were you?

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.330
Not just that night.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.690
You've been frequently going out
on these so-called long rides.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:27.000
Where are you going?
And what are you doing?

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.070
No, I don't mean to blame you.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.910
I simply... I simply want to know to the truth.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.760
I knew you suspected me.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.870
I'll show you where I've been going on my rides.

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:50.010
That small church where the farmers go,
is the place I've been going during my rides.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:53.590
Prepare to be amazed when you go inside, Oscar.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:57.720
There are both farmers and nobles in there.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:15:59.680
They all want to learn what
the new era may bring.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:08.910
Presently, 97% of the French people
are known as the Third Estate.

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:13.360
It consists of farmers, merchants, artisans
and everyone who isn't a noble.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:18.820
What's more, the 97% are taxed so heavily
they can't even afford the day's bread.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:21.150
So who uses that tax money?

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:24.550
It's the remaining 3%, the nobility!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:27.260
The 97% are taxed to support a particular class,

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.190
which makes up only 3%!

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:30.960
Should something like this be allowed?!

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:36.220
I believe God has created all men equal.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:42.110
I guess you could call it a study group?

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:44.730
They have it 2, 3 times a week at that church.

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:49.320
Until recently, I always considered
myself a dense optimist.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.690
But even I can hear it...

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.280
The sound of the new era roaring in...

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:58.250
I was raised in a noble's manor
and work for a noble,

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.700
but that doesn't make me a noble.

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:06.670
At the very lest, I have a right to learn what
the new era may bring... is how I feel.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:16.090
Are you saying the Black Knight represents
the coming of this new era?

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.010
That's not what I'm saying.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:21.140
Just as you said, a thief is a thief.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:26.100
But, it's also true that his actions exemplify
the people's feelings towards the nobility.

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:28.520
I wish to see him!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.070
I wish to capture him and see
what's behind that mask!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:34.400
Is he a mere thief? Or something more?

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.430
You may do as you please.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.620
I won't force you.

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:55.170
Your blonde hair is a dead giveaway.

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:59.310
You're trying to lure out the Black Knight
by posing as him, aren't you?

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:02.420
It's a good idea, but pulling it off will be difficult.

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.090
You're also a bit too slender.

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:05.770
On the other hand,

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.780
I'm a perfect for the part.

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:20.400
Well, Oscar?

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:22.500
How do I look compared to
the Black Knight you saw?

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:24.730
If it were dark, I'd mistake you for him.

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.320
It's the Black Knight!

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:58.870
It's awful. The Black Knight has
been on a thieving spree lately.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:01.830
Indeed! He came and stole a bunch
of my jewels, two nights in a row!

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.080
My manor, too!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:07.040
He only used to steal the expensive items,
but now he's even stealing items of little value!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.490
Hey, Oscar.

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:15.630
Maybe l have a knack for being a thief?

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:22.090
Even so, we'll have to return those jewels to
their owners, once we catch the Black Knight.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.070
A knight must follow the code and be honorable.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:26.860
Understood.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.240
Once this job is finished,

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:32.020
you're free to go to your study group
or wherever you'd like everyday.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.650
Let me say this frankly, Oscar.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:39.910
The tide of time is turning against the nobles.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:42.220
And when it does, there's no
need for you to hesitate.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:44.370
You're not a noble, after all.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.720
<i>What are you saying, Oscar?</i>

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:50.360
<i>Do you really think I'm trying to learn about
the coming age solely for my own good?</i>

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:53.000
<i>Do you really believe I would abandon you?</i>

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:56.340
<i>Oscar, I'm doing it for your sake as much as mine!</i>

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.800
André, it's almost dusk. Let's get ready.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.870
Okay...

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.680
Are you all right, Oscar?

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.570
Y-Yeah... It's nothing serious.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.530
But... I have a bad feeling...

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:22.780
I feel as though something precious will be lost...

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.700
That's nonsense.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.230
I don't just have a knack for it.

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:05.790
I just might be a genius!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:17.850
Damn imposter, using my name
to fulfill your own greed!

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:18.340
It's unforgivable!

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:23.750
It's about time you showed yourself.

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:25.300
What took you so long, Black Knight?

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:26.320
What?!

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.060
It's over.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:31.010
Surrender yourself!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:32.100
Damn...

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.930
So it was a trap to lure me out.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:34.980
I see...

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:58.080
André!

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:04.690
M-My eye...!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.140
André!

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:33.120
To be continued

